WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Nexus 2.0 · triple-tap launcher
Native root on the glasses: Activities cards, Notifications and Applications

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:15.600
Quick card commands
Media Deck right on its card: Previous · Play/Pause · Next

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.900
Integrated Media Deck player
Cover, title, progress and transport controls

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:25.900
Todo / Groceries page
A checklist page inside Nexus

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:32.500
Relay · Type on the phone
The draft appears live in the glasses thread and stays unsent

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.100
Relay · Send is its own step
Exact chat bubbles, Dictate on the glasses, Type on the phone

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:49.400
You choose when activities float
Automatic · Always visible · Home only · On changes · Activities only. On changes: 3 / 5 / 10 s windows

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:55.200
Floating band on the glasses home
Floats for the event window, then steps aside; the Activities card stays

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:02.200
Withdrawn notifications
Gone from the root, still in the bounded Notifications history

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:11.400
Open Navigation from the launcher
The Navigation activity card opens route guidance, map and commands

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:21.000
Walking navigation
Follow, whole route or full screen — and Text, Minimap or Panel while you walk

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Navigation floating on home
Live minimap and route guidance over the glasses home screen

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:33.300
Smooth full-screen map
Full-screen walking route · simulated position

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:36.500
Rokid Nexus 2.0
Update both hubs (phone and glasses) and your plugins
